EX.CO Background
EX.CO was founded in 2012 with a simple idea: publishers should fully own—and fully benefit from their video strategy. The technology eventually evolved into a smarter, machine-learning-driven video technology built to help media companies grow revenue without adding complexity.
Over the years, EX.CO expanded from a lightweight video player into a comprehensive online video platform (OVP) and a machine learning-driven yield engine to maximize revenue, helping media owners capture greater value from every impression. Today, its technology powers video experiences across CTV, web, mobile, and digital out-of-home.
Today, EX.CO serves leading media organizations worldwide—such as Advance Local, Hearst Newspapers, Motorsport Network, The Arena Group, Patch, PlayWorks, and Carwow—while staying true to its core mission: Simply smarter video technology fueling growth for media leaders.


